ineating why these classes are grouped and sorted separately (e.g. why `SchemaEditorClass` isn't included in the list). (It makes sense to group them together because they share a common role and are used in the same way.) And because they're grouped separately and used differently, I think that makes it okay to use a different naming convention. Yes, it's unfortunate, but I think it would be worse to add six more attributes that don't conform to PEP 8 / the coding standards.\n","created_at":"2016-09-06T17:12:05Z","updated_at":"2016-09-08T06:22:48Z","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/7206#discussion_r77677740","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/7206","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/comments/77677740"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/7206#discussion_r77677740"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/7206"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/comments/77677740/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":null,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":77668016,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":12,"position":1,"subject_type":"line","is_copilot_code_review":false,"copilot_code_review_sources":[]},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/comments/77836953","pull_request_review_id":null,"id":77836953,"node_id":"MDI0OlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0UmV2aWV3Q29tbWVudDc3ODM2OTUz","diff_hunk":"@@ -9,9 +9,7 @@\n \n class DatabaseWrapper(MySQLDatabaseWrapper):\n     SchemaEditorClass = MySQLGISSchemaEditor\n-\n-    def __init__(self, *args, **kwargs):\n-        super(DatabaseWrapper, self).__init__(*args, **kwargs)\n-        self.features = DatabaseFeatures(self)\n-        self.ops = MySQLOperations(self)\n-        self.introspection = MySQL